summary:
Return information gathered by the getrusage() system call. Times in the report are measured in milliseconds.

   An example of using rusage():

void create()
{
    mapping info;

    info = rusage();
    write("user time = " + info["utime"] + "ms\n");
    write("system time = " + info["stime"] + "ms\n");
}

The mapping returned by rusage() includes these keys: utime, stime, maxrss, ixrss, idrss, isrss, minflt, majflt, nswap, inblock, oublock, msgsnd, msgrcv, nsignals, nvcsw, nivcsw
